0..78 Comment "//! The prefixes of a seat\'s protocol: the record of the moves a seat has made"
79..158 Comment "//! so far, admitted while its run is still open, as a monitor checks a session"
159..184 Comment "//! one message at a time"
185..256 Comment "//! [Bocchi-2017-monitoring_networks_through_multiparty_session_types]."
257..337 Comment "//! `Prefix(S)` holds every record the protocol accepts so far, complete or not;"
338..407 Comment "//! `Run(S)` holds only the complete ones (`./seat-evolution.gandr`)."
